### 6.6 Dynamic Styles

```typescript
render() {
  return html`
    <!-- Dynamic class binding -->
    <div class="card ${this.active ? 'card--active' : ''}">

    <!-- classMap directive (preferred) -->
    <div class=${classMap({
      card: true,
      'card--active': this.active,
      'card--disabled': this.disabled,
    })}>

    <!-- styleMap directive -->
    <div style=${styleMap({
      backgroundColor: this.bgColor,
      width: `${this.width}px`,
      opacity: this.visible ? '1' : '0',
    })}>

    <!-- CSS part for external styling -->
    <div part="header">
      <h2 part="title">${this.title}</h2>
    </div>
  `;
}
```

