### 8.6 Event Bubbling & Composed

```
Event Propagation in Shadow DOM:

<parent-app>
  ┌── shadow root ──────────────────┐
  │  <child-element>                │
  │    ┌── shadow root ───────────┐ │
  │    │  <button @click>         │ │   ← Event origin
  │    │                          │ │
  │    │ bubbles:true → goes up   │ │
  │    └──────────────────────────┘ │
  │                                 │
  │  composed:true → crosses here   │
  │  composed:false → stops here    │
  └─────────────────────────────────┘

bubbles: true    → Event travels up the DOM tree
composed: true   → Event crosses shadow DOM boundaries
composed: false  → Event stays within the shadow root
```

