### 17.1 Patterns for State Management

```
State Management Approaches in Lit:
├── 1. Component State (@property, @state) — Local state
├── 2. Events (CustomEvent) — Child-to-parent communication
├── 3. Properties (.prop binding) — Parent-to-child data flow
